f\" situations. They all are \"good\" solutions as opposed to the \"you will rot and die\" solutions. So huzzah for the British Government for taking care of us! ","reviewtitle":"Sorry Charlie..","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2008-08-11 23:58:44","createdate":"2008-08-11 23:58:44","stars":"4"},{"reviewtitle":"8919986730","reviewbody":"41509\ncitizen benefits\n","stars":"5","reviewer":"phonetic13790","reviewdate":"2023-06-01 23:12:07","createdate":"2023-06-01 23:12:07","reviewer_itemname":"@phonetic13790"}],"server":"dn600200.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"flagged_as_porn":{"@phonetic13790":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"details page"},"sys_last_changed":"2023-06-12 14:41:11.644926"}},"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn600200":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5429304687"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-10 20:28:18.664342"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1669379999,"workable_servers":["dn600200.us.archive.org"]}